{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "ef5a02bb399065eab08e80bdfc1b224312e339f0f4f826c5422ceb94acfe4f2a", "ja": "意外とスパルタ☆★読モ師匠", "zh": "意外斯巴达☆★读者模特师父", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1e5af972bf8d8e89441996131794a72b5508b4e42b80a99e4a4a320ea41e8e01", "ja": "モデルの真髄を掴むため、読モ師匠こと恵美\nの特別レッスンを受ける一同。腹ペコになっ\nてしまうが、美奈子の料理で回復、届いたば\nかりの新曲のデモを聴いて気力も充実、その\n日は遅くまで特訓をこなすのだった。", "zh": "为了掌握模特的精髓，大家接受了被称为读者模特师父的惠美的特别训练。虽然大家都饿得前胸贴后背，但在美奈子的料理下恢复了精神，听过刚送到的新歌Demo后干劲也更加充足，当天便一直特训到很晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c47b311762a6813644d915edc0017f8efba0997190d056385d589263d800bf36", "ja": "（奈緒と美奈子の希望で、今日から特別レッスンを\n行うことになった。内容はもちろん……）", "zh": "（应奈绪和美奈子的请求，从今天开始进行特别训练。内容当然是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "f63e6393b9587576d27fe85df706ed5f1f2aa3528bded275238182caffd2ba0f", "ja": "というわけで、今日から特別レッスンを始めます！\n読モ師匠、お願いします！", "zh": "所以，从今天开始进行特别训练！\n读者模特师父，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "9759e24cd13b993df17414c6eb6781bc982c893acff2e9e28955a440683529c9", "ja": "あ、もうしゃべっていいの？　やっほ！\nなんか助けてって言われたから、手伝いにきたよ。", "zh": "啊，现在可以说话了吗？呀吼！\n有人叫我来帮忙，所以我就来帮忙啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "1b4d196d7490fa220b4c89141723a4c865f908552459b0bbd7726e411735ca25", "ja": "まあアタシは読モだっただけだから、\nプロのモデルとはちょっと違うんだけどさ。", "zh": "不过我也只是当过读者模特，和专业模特还是有点不一样啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "2837f6b932a125ca0d1971d4dadab503acbd89c60b78b36619ec9614169c0675", "ja": "でも、アタシが教えられることは、全力で教えるよ！\nビシバシいくからついてきて！　なんてね、にゃはは♪", "zh": "不过，我能教你的东西，会竭尽全力教给你！\n接下来我会严格训练，你可要跟上哦！开玩笑的，呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "200da81eef51216722fb6aeda3007096cada2c9b77d970419df81e64e06efd6f", "ja": "オフなのにありがとう、恵美。\nすごく助かるよ。", "zh": "明明是休息日还特意来帮忙，谢谢你，惠美。\n真是帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "5bf31610b2261b089ac3ea5d88153c47c9c493248a0a99e25a6dd42d78f39fc0", "ja": "気にしないでよ、{$P$}。\n仲間が困ってるんだもん、できるコトくらいするよ！", "zh": "别在意啦，{$P$}。同伴遇到麻烦了嘛，能帮上的我都会帮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5c65bc5bb7b6aa4a7f10e9bd07bb9fe4266de874b76b98a07c4e4623a247662e", "ja": "っていうか、アタシもレッスン受けるの？\nコーディネートを手伝うとかじゃなくて？", "zh": "话说回来，我也要接受训练吗？\n不是帮忙搭配服装之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "8f3383dbda8a432ae8e5b5f6856f10c6ab34d2f92c5e03795a2efcd02cc0f980", "ja": "まあまあ。ついでやし、歩もやっとけばええやん。\nなんかの役に立つかもしれへんし！", "zh": "好啦好啦，反正也是顺便，步也一起练练嘛。说不定什么时候能派上用场呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "0e3b971a2c0692820ab9a12ff3c41bc7dcc99f149ad16f03bd805dea80184c46", "ja": "一緒にがんばろう、歩ちゃん！\nこのレッスンで、モデルの真髄をつかもうね！", "zh": "一起加油吧，步！\n通过这次训练，一起掌握模特的精髓吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a890738d9763a13a1a80b4b90b533371c0f97535c269b57456fe969d21afda5", "ja": "モデルの真髄かぁ……たしかに役に立つかも？\nオッケー、そういうコトなら乗った！", "zh": "模特的精髓啊……确实可能会派上用场？\n好，既然这样，那我就参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "a067bcbaebeb7bb598be1cde4014625910d0bf940c0d5d991320c808b11fd409", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそくだけど、始めるよーっ！", "zh": "那么事不宜迟，现在就开始吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f301a873eac77b013c9b8960c10ed33cdbf0ac68c71612e7e81da16884f8a993", "ja": "（そして、読モ師匠によるモデル訓練が始まった。\nまずは、ウォーキングの練習から……）", "zh": "（然后，模特读者老师的模特训练开始了。首先从走台步的练习开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1c5ca045412f8ff434dba7a3efc01bc8eec88ab1dca02e87cbc93e635e6879e", "ja": "頭のてっぺんから、糸でピーンって引っ張られてる\nイメージで立ってみて。はい、奈緒！　やってみて！", "zh": "想象一下，有一根线从头顶一直把你往上提，绷直身体站好。来，奈绪！试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "5cf45cd29e7c0dc018f9428000fbdd73892b342aad77fc04ef586c25a3cb97af", "ja": "い、糸！？　うう、イメージしろって言われても……。\nようわからんけど、こんな感じ……？", "zh": "线、线！？唔唔，就算你让我去想象……\n虽然搞不太懂，是这种感觉吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "3cc9a4587e67026a63bd2f2de2cd34491502e45b1c88a50c8d56e44bfd6bbd22", "ja": "んー、もうちょっとしなやかに！　猫みたく！\nんじゃ、美奈子もやってみて！", "zh": "嗯——动作要再柔韧一点！像猫一样！\n那，美奈子也来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "57db7965f3bf24d4ae38100175fcb1d66488878299b10e1b8f4ebbfd2ae87e8c", "ja": "は、はい、師匠！　猫みたいにかぁ……猫、猫……\nにゃーん？　こ、こんな感じ……かな！？", "zh": "好、好的，师父！要像猫一样啊……猫，猫……\n喵——？这、这样……可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "a7e93804594789cd3f2e6bfc6c2fcc2b3b5a45bd2ac7df17622acaac7ced8e8c", "ja": "いや、鳴き声はやらなくていいんだけど……\n歩は……わっ、すごいね～！　全然ブレてないよ！", "zh": "不是，倒也不用学叫声啦……\n步……哇，好厉害啊～！完全没有晃动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ab5a678d72324390c4dc90489a3b337f1c43d24e097a3488371231769cec88ec", "ja": "えっ？　ま、まあね！\nアタシ、ダンスで鍛えてるからさ！　……へへ♪", "zh": "诶？这、这个嘛，当然咯！\n我可是通过跳舞锻炼出来的！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "8e93cf7c95e3a9bfe54f3123084ff27cb4937c9c53f3b21cce3cbb7650b5904f", "ja": "歩き方は何度も繰り返して、慣れることが大切だよ！\nそれじゃ、部屋の端まで、みんなで歩いてみよっか！", "zh": "走路要反复练习很多次，习惯了才是最重要的哦！\n那么，大家一起走到房间那头去试试吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d53b97fee6c6e80b3646e90cb66a0d1a42f79a0cdcc7675695b94e4c2d6dffe3", "ja": "（その後も、服の見せ方やポージングなど、\n恵美のスパルタ特訓は続いていった……）", "zh": "（之后，无论是服装的展示方式还是摆姿势之类的，\n惠美的斯巴达式特训都还在继续……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "574f6527e0c01691a9e2f362c3beb5049fb27e1cc983ec913e9e7052a2a1531f", "ja": "ちょっ、ちょっと待った～！\n疲れすぎて、足が動かへん……。", "zh": "等、等一下～！  \n累得不行了，腿都动不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b4bd51383ef9326f288608d78f712cd74d155b8c8c89323ac4f26001a0ff0ed8", "ja": "いや～、モデル歩きって簡単そうに見えて、けっこう\n体力使うんだな！　アタシ、お腹空いてきちゃったよ。", "zh": "哎～，走模特步看着挺简单，其实还挺\n耗体力的呢！我都觉得肚子饿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "841ccb3d1e745093bebd16182df212e92b731a43073fdaee26ede5c731207551", "ja": "わかる。アタシもお腹空いちゃった！", "zh": "懂的。我也肚子饿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e65623b5a9f5a26bc31f93a44e32bd970414605d9f9f1a582eaa51aeb5b4e63", "ja": "いや、恵美は何もしてへんやろ！", "zh": "不是，惠美你什么都没干吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "bae27cc6965f8b8fb73209cd9743803a0178a40fbdce92cdff4fbc240e32ea8c", "ja": "えー、声出すのってけっこうお腹空くんだよ？\n教えるほうも、疲れるんだって！", "zh": "诶——，喊出声可是挺费肚子的哦？\n教别人也很累的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "bbf188aedfa92f17a31ce88a87b32be61cb2b2f06901efa8f509895660a48b60", "ja": "ふふっ。みんな、お腹が空いたんだね！　じゃあ、\nキッチンでぱぱっと何か作ってきちゃおうかな？", "zh": "呵呵。大家都饿了吧！那我去厨房很快做点什么来吃，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "42c8fe5cdb2f8a693c07af53ae5736e5a6c29cf193e9a916a5186c68843c0d60", "ja": "{$P$}さん、構いませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "06013369b9a92bde4f231f62fb27a1d96c7fa1cad17a86e9aa1da399b482f239", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nそれじゃみんな、少し休憩にしよう。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n那么大家，稍微休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "66f38e177968bac11dec81b984723056757ca2833a5c64772d52050ef426b722", "ja": "おいしーい！！", "zh": "好好吃喔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "66f38e177968bac11dec81b984723056757ca2833a5c64772d52050ef426b722", "ja": "おいしーい！！", "zh": "好好吃喔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "66f38e177968bac11dec81b984723056757ca2833a5c64772d52050ef426b722", "ja": "おいしーい！！", "zh": "好好吃喔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "fbad4e2ad5e6d419e4deea75b484a838adb326f5efe4335711c763c26591fea4", "ja": "すごいな……5分も経ってないのに、こんなに料理が！\nなんだか魔法みたいだ。", "zh": "真厉害……明明连5分钟都还没到，居然已经做出这么多菜了！总觉得就像魔法一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "def9547fd589201c0612c31de113071e3afd12e980bab57eeee439ef41b166c1", "ja": "えへへ♪　ほめられると、もっと出しちゃいますよ～？\nおかわり、たくさんありますからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 被夸奖的话，我会再多端一些出来哦～？\n还有很多，可以尽管添饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "5f8647096944a698cd689d8c9d960a4afd572a1c7837d9436b12fb5c5fa61626", "ja": "美奈子、私も！　私もおかわりー！", "zh": "美奈子，我也要！我也要加餐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "0a5e0b5ecfcfd036e7c5ddec6376071e701edadbd835e3af6614b0b4b996853b", "ja": "はいはい。ちょっと待ってね、奈緒ちゃん♪", "zh": "好啦好啦，稍等一下哦，奈绪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7f78f10b5e14c4c1140202dc45fe81c5d724c775562c8ce172727c9cba452e1a", "ja": "ところで、美奈子と奈緒の新曲デモが届いたんだ。\nちょうどいいから、みんなで聞いてみないか？", "zh": "对了，美奈子和奈绪的新歌小样送到了。\n正好，要不要大家一起听听？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "bb69f66a21631fa741181e9148c3ad9a9154a5205817e9802e74aff30e2e6527", "ja": "ホンマですか！？　はよ聞きたい！\n{$P$}さん、はよ～！", "zh": "真的吗！？我想赶紧听！  \n{$P$}先生，快点嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1040_019min", "source_sha256": "c5b956cd9e746608e104a5d7202d0c5d39a19ad0854cf5e519f84eab86a723fb", "ja": "私と奈緒ちゃんの新曲かー。どんな曲だろう？\nふふっ、楽しみですね♪", "zh": "我和奈绪的新歌啊——会是什么样的歌呢？嘿嘿，真期待呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "9b14ca1dd383dee5983f26120542e0c21dfbcd791329f6e02d23758bb162570c", "ja": "よし、わかった。それじゃ流すぞ！", "zh": "好，我知道了。那就放给你们听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "80fb5922818d0ffe57050ca30c8220d75c8a880e48453d705313c2d649a7728e", "ja": "へ～っ、いい曲じゃん！　なんか、\nショーでかかっててもおかしくないってカンジ？", "zh": "哦～挺不错的歌嘛！感觉就算放在演出上也完全不奇怪，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1044_037nao", "source_sha256": "7dc9e2c72416f5c5ee0f51725551b5608a53a6b549c0d4fb6fa443745cd39762", "ja": "せやな！　ええと……クール？　セクシー？\nいや、ちゃうな……わかった、スタイリッシュや！", "zh": "没错！嗯……酷？性感？\n不对，不是这个……我知道了，是时尚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1045_019min", "source_sha256": "ccec642ab4f428214c599f7675a40c6496bb0f9052df086bf8fef46221b285f2", "ja": "本当……カッコいいのてんこ盛りですね！　\nこれを私たちが歌うのか～。", "zh": "真的……帅气元素满满呢！  \n这个要由我们来唱啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6446e08808afb921d5aa1916adbb4d0edc987cbff9d738b7c40a2554e5292451", "ja": "ホント、イイ曲だな～。これはふたりとも、\nユニットも人気投票も、相当がんばんなきゃだな！", "zh": "真的，是首好歌啊～。这下我们俩无论是组合还是人气投票，都得相当努力才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "956e67b312e22e972aae85cfe75ef871c0c679bc6f584bfc7e38a0fa7e971b07", "ja": "せやな～。でも今日は、もう疲れてヘトヘトやし。\nなぁなぁ、今からみんなで銭湯にでも……。", "zh": "是啊～不过今天已经累得筋疲力尽了。呐呐，我们现在一起去澡堂什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1048_020meg", "source_sha256": "43929ef165d293746e30613c9abe33d1cbd8409ac837d6692f2cb141ba786a73", "ja": "うんうん。それじゃ、\n午後の特訓も気合い入れてがんばろうね！", "zh": "嗯嗯。那我们下午的特训也打起精神加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1049_037nao", "source_sha256": "3cad398a03095e14b0bbb11563522403ff5fe9c6ab225f065694337e4a041ed9", "ja": "って、まだやるんかーい！\n恵美、ちょっとスパルタすぎなんちゃう！？", "zh": "话说，还要继续啊——！\n惠美，你是不是有点太斯巴达了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "54ea7c9a89b36db99640a00f28f1ebef35c00610cf2e6ac6b4e68f3d599ca638", "ja": "モデルの道は1日にしてならず、っていうでしょ！\n次は……「ポーズ千本ノック」いくよー！", "zh": "不是都说，模特之路，非1日不能成嘛！\n接下来……开始“姿势千次训练”吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1051_037nao", "source_sha256": "d60ec94450ab6543cbfeee78a1f9f795a3638a29bf00d62b6a4055759926c777", "ja": "そんな紗代子みたいなノリのモデル、イヤや～！\nもうカンベンしてー！！", "zh": "我才不要当那种像纱代子一样的模特啊～！\n已经受够啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1052_019min", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1053_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "8fdc46295d19181df4d2301f9b066c10b93a08589f1b320752387ef37e4257af", "ja": "（美奈子の美味しい料理で英気を養った後、\n読モ師匠によるスパルタ特訓は遅くまで続いた……）", "zh": "（吃了美奈子做的美味料理，养足精神后，读者模特老师的斯巴达式特训一直持续到深夜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "ac6a84ee434f296c01e8ba6bfd8df70a736c56fb22a253e083cac15bd0f353fc", "ja": "（なんとなく、顔つきが変わってきた気がする。\n美奈子も奈緒も、自信がついてるといいんだけど）", "zh": "（总觉得她们的表情都变了。\n希望美奈子和奈绪也因此变得更有自信了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
